# UI testing: the competition robot plugged into a field controller, as at an
# event. The brain starts disabled, so pre-auton screens (an autonomous
# selector on the brain or controller screen) run as they would while the
# robot waits on the field. The field-control page (http://localhost:8765/field)
# opens in the browser: START runs a timed match, Manual switches it yourself.
#   V5Sim ui-test path\to\program.bin
# Port map as in competition.args:
#   1-6 drive (blue, right side reversed in code)   7 intake (green)
#   8 optical   9 GPS   10 IMU   11 radio (wireless controller)
#   12 rotation (2.75" tracking wheel)   13 distance (front)   14 AI Vision
@robots/competition.args
--competition field
